      "lines": [
        "Ulti ho gayin sab tadbeerein"
      ],
      "en": "Every remedy went awry."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.0,
      "end": 35.0,
      "lines": [
        "Kuchh na dawa ne kaam kiya"
      ],
      "en": "The medicine brought no relief."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.0,
      "end": 61.0,
      "lines": [
        "Dekha is beemari-e-dil ne"
      ],
      "en": "See what this ailment of the heart has done."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.0,
      "end": 71.0,
      "lines": [
        "Aakhir kaam tamaam kiya"
      ],
      "en": "In the end, it finished me."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.0,
      "end": 81.0,
      "lines": [
        "Ulti ho gayin sab tadbeerein"
      ],
      "en": "Every remedy went awry."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.0,
      "end": 113.96,
      "lines": [
        "Ahd-e-jawani ro ro kaata"
      ],
      "en": "I wept my youth away."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.96,
      "end": 124.0,
      "lines": [
        "Peeri mein leen aankhein moond"
      ],
      "en": "In old age I closed my eyes."
    },
    {
      "start": 124.0,
      "end": 139.0,
      "lines": [
        "Yaani raat bahut the jaage"
      ],
      "en": "I had been awake so long that night."
    },
    {
      "start": 139.0,
      "end": 148.0,
      "lines": [
        "Subah hui aaraam kiya"
      ],
      "en": "When dawn came, I rested."
    },
    {
      "start": 148.0,
      "end": 157.32,
      "lines": [
        "Ulti ho gayin sab tadbeerein"
      ],
      "en": "Every remedy went awry."
    },
    {
      "start": 161.08,
      "end": 212.08,
      "lines": [
        "Yaan ke sapaid-o-siyaah mein humko dakhl jo hai so itna hai"
      ],
      "en": "My part in the workings of this world was only this."
    },
    {
      "start": 212.08,
      "end": 239.85,
      "lines": [
        "Raat ko ro ro subah kiya, aur subah ko jyon tyon shaam kiya"
      ],
      "en": "I wept the night into dawn and somehow made it through to dusk."
    },
    {
      "start": 240.08,
      "end": 250.08,
      "lines": [
        "Ulti ho gayin sab tadbeerein"
      ],
      "en": "Every remedy went awry."
    },
    {
      "start": 265.08,
      "end": 299.08,
      "lines": [
        "Meer ke deen-o-mazhab ko ab poochhte kya ho, un ne to"
      ],
      "en": "Why ask now what faith Meer keeps?"
    },
    {
      "start": 299.08,
      "end": 324.08,
      "lines": [
        "Qashqa kheencha, dair mein baitha"
      ],
      "en": "He marked his brow and took his seat in the temple."
    },
    {
      "start": 324.08,
      "end": 333.0,
      "lines": [
        "Kab ka tark-e-Islam kiya"
      ],
      "en": "He left Islam long ago."
    },
